Clean-room pieces

adaptive-table is a clean-room reimplementation from a behavior description
only. No names, icons, or rows from that reference were copied. Columns drop,
fold, and stretch to the container width.

The multi-view pieces (multi-view-core, use-multi-view, view-table,
view-kanban, view-calendar, view-timeline, view-grouped-list, view-gallery,
record-properties, and the multi-view block) are an independent implementation
of the common pattern: one collection shown as a table, board, calendar,
timeline, list, or gallery. No shadcn/studio code, data, or assets were
consulted.

